  "value": "coins is a list of distinct positive denominations, each available without limit, and target >= 0. Return a list counts aligned with coins, where counts[i] is how many coins of denomination coins[i] are used, such that the coins sum to target with the fewest coins in total. If several combinations use the fewest coins, prefer more coins of the largest denomination, then of the next largest, and so on. Return [] when target cannot be made.",
